        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Axl Rose, Paul Tobias, Robin Finck\n- Songs: \"Prostitute\"\n- Bands: Guns N' Roses, Nine Inch Nails\n- Lists: 100 Greatest Artists of Hard Rock\n\nFacts:\n- Axl Rose and Paul Tobias wrote the song \"Prostitute.\"\n- An additional contributor to \"Prostitute\" was an American guitarist.\n- The American guitarist was Robin Finck.\n- Robin Finck played in Guns N' Roses and Nine Inch Nails.\n- Guns N' Roses and Nine Inch Nails have both appeared on a list of the 100 Greatest Artists of Hard Rock.",
